{%- doc -%}
  Renders a mobile-only duplicate of the product's product-type tag, title,
  rating, short description, price and savings badge, shown above the product gallery on
  viewports narrower than 1000px (see ".product-mobile-summary" in theme.css and the
  "product-mobile-summary" grid area in sections/main-product.liquid).

  The "real", editable blocks still render in their normal position inside product-info
  and stay visible there on desktop; they're hidden on mobile via the "data-mobile-hero"
  attribute added in snippets/product-info.liquid. This duplicate is presentational only
  (it re-renders the same underlying snippets with plain product data, not the blocks
  themselves), so it intentionally carries no block.shopify_attributes.

  The price can change per variant, and <product-rerender> (see assets/theme.js) only
  patches elements it can match by "data-block-type" + "data-block-id" against the
  freshly-fetched section HTML. So the price here carries the same "data-block-type" as
  its real counterpart, plus the real price block's ID with a "-mobile" suffix (kept
  distinct so the two copies don't get cross-matched, but still reproducible between this
  render and the one <product-rerender> fetches after a variant change). The tag, title,
  rating and short description are all product-level (not variant-level), so they never
  change on variant swap and don't need this treatment.

  @param {object} [product]
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- if product != blank -%}
  {%- assign price_block = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'price' | first -%}

  <div class="product-info product-mobile-summary">
    {%- render 'pdp-product-pill' -%}

    <h2 class="product-title">{{- product.title | downcase -}}</h2>

    {%- render 'pdp-rating' -%}
    {%- render 'pdp-short-description' -%}

    {%- if product.selected_or_first_available_variant != nil -%}
      <div class="h-stack gap-3 pdp-price-section">
        <div class="product-info__block-item" data-block-type="price" {% if price_block %}data-block-id="{{ price_block.id }}-mobile"{% endif %}>
          {%- render 'price-list', product: product, variant: product.selected_or_first_available_variant, context: 'product' -%}
        </div>

        {%- render 'pdp-price-savings' -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
